You're out of luck for Mjollnir unless you can find it.  There are
plenty of other artifacts you could get as gifts, though.  Getting
crowned will allow that to happen.  Switch from sac-only to get
artifacts to sac-reconcile-pray cycle to get crowned.  Once crowned
switch back to sac-only.

>  Or would it already be a level I've visited?

The only possibilities are it's on a level you have already visited,
likely underneath some other item, or it was dsestroyed on a leel you
have already visited.

Bones levels that have not been loaded into the game do not exist in the
game so their contents are not relevant.


